From: pieroviano <piero.viano@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 18:49:41 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add BindableComponent (bindable non-control base)

Closes API-COMPLETENESS.md P1 item 3. BindableComponent is the base for a
non-control component that supports data binding - it carries DataBindings and a
BindingContext exactly as a Control does. It was absent, so
class MyComponent : BindableComponent did not compile (a net10 gap; the type is
absent from the net48 baseline).

Implemented as an abstract Component : IBindableComponent with a lazily-created
DataBindings (ControlBindingsCollection over itself) and BindingContext, and a
BindingContextChanged event raised on assignment.

Covered by BindableComponentFunctionalTests (is-a Component/IBindableComponent,
non-null DataBindings, BindingContext round-trip + event, interface reach). Full
Forms suite green at 2491.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
